Stubelius Ultimate H3
Copyright (c) 2026 stuubszzz

Built on Muse Minimax Director V1.2 and its companion Muse Minimax Refine V1.2
(Copyright (c) 2026 Muse Collective, MIT License). Their engine code is carried
in muse_minimax_director.py and muse_minimax_refine.py, with changes (per-chunk
LoRAs, takes, renamed server routes and front-end names). The Director window
(js/stubelius_director*.js) is a new front end that keeps the Director's
timeline format.

