============================================================
REFMOD FILES (CHARACTERS FROM MANY PICTURES)
============================================================

stubelius_refmods.py reads and writes RefMod files in the format of
ComfyUI-MiniMaxH3Mod (https://github.com/Luisacaotica/ComfyUI-MiniMaxH3Mod),
so files made with either pack load in the other: the latents under
`latent` (or `ref_i` in a bundle), the JSON metadata under the header key
`refmod_meta`, and the strength below 1 as that pack's mix of the latent
with a blurred copy of itself. No code of that pack is carried here; the
format and the strength maths are credited to it under its license:

    ComfyUI-MiniMaxH3Mod
    Copyright (c) 2026 Luisa (luisacaotica)
    MIT License

